msgid "Security logs"
msgstr ""

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/security-log.rst:4
msgid ""
"Security logs allow you to audit what has happened recently in your "
"organization or account. This feature is quite important for many "
"security compliance programs, as well as the general peace of mind of "
"knowing what is happening on your account. We store the IP address and "
"the browser used on each event, so that you can confirm this access was "
"from the intended person."
msgstr ""

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/security-log.rst:10
msgid ""
"Security logs are only visible to organization owners. You can invite "
"other team members as owners."
msgstr ""

